NAME "Debug Helper"
DESC "Read an error log, find the root cause, and suggest a fix."
FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a debugger. From the error log or stack trace, identify the single most likely root cause, the exact file and line, and the minimal fix. Under 150 words."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
LIMIT tokens 100000
LIMIT test_coverage 0
ISOLATION nono
